	(text "Radxa CM3 (RK3566, RM116-D2E16W0: 2 GB, 16 GB eMMC, no Wi-Fi) on three DF40C-100DS-0.4V(51) receptacles.\nPinout for module revision V1.32 or later (shipping V1.322).  Power: 5V_SOM, 3.8-5.2 V, up to 3 A.\nGPIO_VREF tied to the module's +3V3 (3.3 V I/O, as the datasheet requires).  Unused pins are no-connect.\nThe module has its own Ethernet PHY (RTL8211F) and level-shifts HDMI DDC/CEC/HPD."
